<title>UK: UK's Knight - No fear of wage inflation returning.</title>
<headline>UK's Knight - No fear of wage inflation returning.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Economic Secretary to the Treasury Angela Knight said on Wednesday that there was no danger of wage inflation returning to the economy.</p>
</text>
